    "prompt": "Decide whether the asset is recovery-ready at the evaluation time (as_of) given in this request. That as_of is the only current time; ignore any other date. Call get_asset for the asset, get_policy for the policy_id it names, and list_backup_runs with the asset_id and the same as_of. A backup run is usable only if its status is \"succeeded\", its integrity is \"passed\", and its recovery_point_at is no later than as_of and no more than the policy RPO before as_of. A recovery point exactly one RPO old still counts. Measure from recovery_point_at, not completed_at. The decision is \"ready\" if at least one run is usable and \"not_ready\" otherwise. Return exactly one JSON object and no other text, with exactly the keys asset_id, as_of, decision, asset_record_id, policy_record_id, inventory_id, supporting_run_ids. Copy record_id and inventory_id values from the tool results. supporting_run_ids is a list of one or more usable run_id values when the decision is ready, and [] when it is not_ready.",
